#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""hypr-alttab: a Windows-style Alt+Tab window switcher for Hyprland.

Runs as a small daemon that listens on a unix socket for commands sent by
`hypr-alttab-ctl` (bound to Alt+Tab in hyprland.conf):

    next     start the switcher / move selection forward
    prev     start the switcher / move selection backward
    commit   focus the selected window and close the switcher
    cancel   close the switcher without switching
    quit     stop the daemon

While open, the switcher grabs the keyboard, so it sees the Alt release
itself (which commits, exactly like Windows), plus Tab/Shift+Tab, arrows,
Enter, Escape and Delete (closes the selected window). Clicking a preview
switches to it.
"""

